WEBVTT

00:02.010 --> 00:11.860
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:03.090 --> 00:04.420
This way!

00:05.010 --> 00:06.960
Bro, wait!

00:06.960 --> 00:08.800
Hurry, hurry!

00:09.560 --> 00:11.680
Citron sure is fast today...

00:11.680 --> 00:13.230
You don't need to rush.

00:15.610 --> 00:17.160
Yes, there is no doubt.

00:17.900 --> 00:21.000
The venue of the Ingenuity Festival is right ahead!

00:21.660 --> 00:26.650
This <i>is</i> the biggest ingenuity festival in the Kalos region, after all!

00:26.900 --> 00:28.720
Geez, bro...

00:29.110 --> 00:30.340
Is it really that amazing?

00:30.880 --> 00:33.120
It is more than just amazing!

00:33.440 --> 00:39.600
It's an amazing convention where people from all over Kalos who're proud of their ingenuity skills will come to present a selection of their ingenuities!

00:39.920 --> 00:41.120
Wow!

00:41.120 --> 00:42.310
Aren't you exaggerating?

00:42.630 --> 00:44.190
You will understand what I mean once you see it.

00:44.430 --> 00:46.060
Come on, let us go!

00:46.620 --> 00:47.730
Sounds fun.

00:50.920 --> 00:52.360
It is here!

00:54.480 --> 00:55.970
Whoa!

00:56.440 --> 00:58.410
It's huge!

00:58.900 --> 01:01.430
So this is the venue of the Ingenuity Festival.

01:01.430 --> 01:02.980
Awesome!

01:04.440 --> 01:05.120
That is right.

01:05.120 --> 01:06.580
That is so right!

01:06.870 --> 01:10.880
This is the gathering place of the wits and creativity of Kalos!

01:13.210 --> 01:15.130
Ingenuities... mean romanticism.

01:15.840 --> 01:17.920
They are compilations of humans' wits and creativity!

01:19.140 --> 01:22.590
The cogwheels of my curiosity can no longer be stopped!

01:27.160 --> 01:32.920
Heatbursts at the Ingenuity Festival!

01:33.960 --> 01:43.840
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

01:33.960 --> 01:43.840
Z

01:41.420 --> 01:42.590
That's right, keep it up.

01:44.830 --> 01:45.170
Whoa!

01:46.240 --> 01:46.930
Ugh!

01:48.760 --> 01:49.950
It looks fun!

01:50.810 --> 01:51.980
Huh? What's this?

01:52.300 --> 01:52.940
Ah, this is...

01:53.510 --> 01:55.140
...the welcoming ingenuity.

01:55.400 --> 01:58.960
It is a device that shows you what ingenuities are in an easily understandable way.

01:59.430 --> 02:01.160
Seems kinda complicated.

02:01.160 --> 02:02.900
How do you make it move?

02:04.580 --> 02:05.400
You put this ball...

02:05.550 --> 02:06.580
...in here...

02:10.130 --> 02:10.830
Oh!

02:34.120 --> 02:35.450
It keeps moving the whole time!

02:35.760 --> 02:37.430
Ingenuities are incredible!

02:39.240 --> 02:40.730
I wonder what will happen!

02:56.660 --> 02:56.860
Huh?

02:57.130 --> 03:00.460
Amazing! It is an automatic Berry crusher!

03:00.460 --> 03:01.980
It is really well made, too!

03:02.500 --> 03:05.090
You don't need to go through the trouble of making something like this...

03:08.390 --> 03:09.990
Isn't this easier?

03:11.720 --> 03:13.900
Nonsense! You understand nothing!

03:14.130 --> 03:15.810
Ingenuities are about playfulness!

03:16.450 --> 03:20.540
Playfulness is what gave birth to all kinds of inventions, and what made technology advance.

03:20.800 --> 03:25.400
That means that everything that makes our lives so convenient has its basis in ingenuities!

03:26.050 --> 03:27.860
If you are not prepared to enjoy playfulness,

03:28.180 --> 03:32.450
you will not be able to enjoy the ingenuity rooms!

03:32.980 --> 03:34.570
Playfulness, huh...?

03:35.100 --> 03:35.860
Uh-huh...

03:36.100 --> 03:37.150
I see.

03:38.770 --> 03:40.700
Come on, let us go!

03:46.770 --> 03:47.310
All right!

03:47.710 --> 03:50.070
The "Monster Ball Snatching Ingenuity" is complete!

03:50.630 --> 03:53.770
Now we can steal the participants' monster balls en masse.

03:54.210 --> 03:57.010
Finis Coronat Opus. The end crowns the work.

03:57.340 --> 03:59.420
Uh-huh... So this is what you call "indemnify"?

03:59.770 --> 04:00.740
That's right, indemnify...

04:01.210 --> 04:02.110
Uh, no!

04:02.820 --> 04:06.000
That's when you compensate someone if they suffer some kind of loss, right?

04:06.370 --> 04:08.810
Like when you wreck their car you have to pay up.

04:09.120 --> 04:10.620
That's "indemnity"...

04:11.170 --> 04:12.050
Huh? They're different things?

04:12.270 --> 04:13.750
Totally different!

04:13.970 --> 04:14.510
Uh-huh...

04:15.500 --> 04:21.180
All right then, let's go have a look at what kinds of ingenuity rooms the other participants have created.

04:21.180 --> 04:22.380
Agreed.

04:22.970 --> 04:23.960
Ingenuity...

04:24.130 --> 04:24.730
Ingestion...

04:25.570 --> 04:26.380
Indigenous?

04:29.990 --> 04:32.180
Please sit on these chairs to go up.

04:32.440 --> 04:33.510
Wahey!

04:35.300 --> 04:37.040
Please make sure to exercise caution.

04:37.040 --> 04:37.690
Okay!

04:38.930 --> 04:40.240
All right, we should also...

04:44.290 --> 04:45.940
Harimaron wants to try it too, right?

04:46.510 --> 04:48.860
I'm sure Yancham will like this sort of thing too.

04:59.170 --> 05:00.710
The brats and Pikachu...

05:01.260 --> 05:05.440
Before we proceed with the Monster Ball Snatching Ingenuity, we should get Pikachu.

05:05.850 --> 05:06.170
Yeah.

05:07.020 --> 05:09.240
Since they're going into the ingenuity rooms, our chances are even better.

05:09.960 --> 05:11.020
What do indigenous rooms have to do with this?

05:11.490 --> 05:12.180
That's not...

05:13.970 --> 05:14.180
Huh...?

05:14.540 --> 05:15.310
It won't open.

05:15.670 --> 05:16.460
Maybe push?

05:18.320 --> 05:18.720
It's no use...!

05:19.320 --> 05:21.140
Heh, heh, heh! Well then...

05:22.030 --> 05:22.860
Pull it to the side!

05:24.170 --> 05:24.860
You're right!

05:25.410 --> 05:27.530
This kind of thing is elementary when it comes to ingenuities.

05:29.110 --> 05:30.670
Oh... It's just a wall.

05:32.720 --> 05:33.390
Let me have a try...

05:35.940 --> 05:36.870
Wow!

05:37.410 --> 05:39.110
This is what they call a "hidden door".

05:40.390 --> 05:40.870
Huh?

05:41.510 --> 05:42.880
Pikachu and the others are gone.

05:44.730 --> 05:45.280
Hey!

05:47.120 --> 05:50.310
It looks like we have become separated, so let us meet up again later!

05:50.550 --> 05:51.990
Pikachu, you'll be all right, won't you?

05:53.580 --> 05:54.600
Play nice, okay?

05:55.160 --> 05:56.910
All right, we should proceed as well!

05:57.610 --> 05:59.340
We need to go across these, huh...?

06:01.570 --> 06:02.010
There!

06:03.310 --> 06:04.000
Hup!

06:08.170 --> 06:09.090
Me too!

06:09.460 --> 06:10.140
Oops!

06:13.160 --> 06:13.570
Now!

06:14.850 --> 06:16.710
Eureka, keep it up!

06:17.160 --> 06:17.870
This is fun!

06:18.530 --> 06:18.690
Hup!

06:19.250 --> 06:20.370
Hup!

06:21.150 --> 06:22.720
Bro, you're good!

06:22.720 --> 06:25.340
You're like an entirely different person today, Citron!

06:27.120 --> 06:28.290
All right, let's go to the next one.

07:04.310 --> 07:06.040
So there's some kind of trick to this door too, huh?

07:09.340 --> 07:10.070
It's no use...

07:10.500 --> 07:11.460
It won't budge.

07:13.220 --> 07:14.820
Let me see...

07:17.360 --> 07:18.720
So <i>that's</i> how it works.

07:25.220 --> 07:27.580
How do you open this door?!

07:27.580 --> 07:29.540
If pulling doesn't work, try pushing.

07:31.240 --> 07:32.610
Pushing it does nothing either!

07:34.350 --> 07:35.570
You see, doors...

07:36.390 --> 07:37.520
...can be opened like this.

07:38.290 --> 07:39.510
It was misleading us, huh...?

07:41.280 --> 07:43.170
What's this thing?!

07:43.170 --> 07:43.870
It's a wall.

07:44.280 --> 07:46.600
Heh. You see, walls...

07:48.510 --> 07:49.970
...can be opened like this.

07:50.370 --> 07:51.330
Misleading...

08:21.710 --> 08:23.740
I heard Pikachu's voice somewhere below us!

08:27.780 --> 08:28.500
Sorry...

08:34.310 --> 08:34.950
Ha!

08:36.930 --> 08:39.700
What's up with this Inomoo?

08:39.700 --> 08:40.760
It's "ingenuity".

08:42.340 --> 08:44.200
You could've descended so much more easily like this.

08:46.690 --> 08:48.320
I guess you should sit here, right?

08:58.270 --> 08:58.490
Huh?

08:59.040 --> 09:00.930
This is so well thought out!

09:00.930 --> 09:02.180
It's like an amusement park!

09:03.210 --> 09:03.490
Hm?

09:05.750 --> 09:06.500
Uh...

09:07.240 --> 09:08.300
What's next...

09:08.300 --> 09:10.040
Maybe a different arm will come your way?

09:10.420 --> 09:11.490
I can't wait for that!

09:15.170 --> 09:16.860
Waiting would've been bad...

09:21.420 --> 09:23.430
Eureka, hurry! Hurry!

09:23.430 --> 09:24.770
Yeah, I got it!

09:25.680 --> 09:26.540
Oh, that was close...

09:27.410 --> 09:29.860
This should be a piece of Keikouo!

09:30.270 --> 09:31.020
Hup!

09:31.320 --> 09:31.610
Ha!

09:32.780 --> 09:34.610
We have to hurry and catch up with Pikachu.

09:35.100 --> 09:35.490
All right!

09:39.270 --> 09:40.700
What are they doing to me...?

09:41.960 --> 09:42.660
Whoa!

09:43.080 --> 09:45.740
Just by sitting, I can do exercises for my abdominal muscles...

09:44.540 --> 09:45.740
Gee, I wonder why...

09:49.290 --> 09:49.940
What's this...?

09:55.730 --> 09:59.250
Ah, it's one of those ingenious automatons that bring you tea!

09:59.250 --> 10:00.920
Yes, they are famous, are they not?

10:00.920 --> 10:02.200
So cute!

10:02.200 --> 10:03.590
It's well made.

10:05.590 --> 10:07.070
It wants us to take the tea, huh?

10:07.740 --> 10:08.290
Hot!

10:09.110 --> 10:10.270
What are you doing?

10:11.140 --> 10:13.730
Well... I guess that was the trick behind it.

10:14.030 --> 10:15.600
This is what playfulness is about!

10:23.980 --> 10:27.380
That automaton has good manners, what with the bowing and all.

10:28.210 --> 10:29.240
You think so?

11:02.060 --> 11:05.050
Geez, where has Pikachu gone?

11:05.050 --> 11:06.490
Maybe it's farther ahead.

11:06.490 --> 11:09.360
Oh, how convenient. I was just thinking about taking a break.

11:09.780 --> 11:10.120
Uh...

11:10.440 --> 11:12.500
Huh?

11:13.030 --> 11:14.390
This feels nice, I think!

11:15.980 --> 11:16.290
Huh?

11:16.860 --> 11:17.900
What's going on?

11:18.110 --> 11:20.340
Maybe a different arm will come your way?

11:20.580 --> 11:20.790
Huh?

11:21.320 --> 11:22.380
From where? Why?

11:27.290 --> 11:29.400
Oh my, that's a cute doll.

11:29.400 --> 11:31.330
That's one of those famous Japanese automatons.

11:31.920 --> 11:33.600
My, are you serving us tea?

11:34.460 --> 11:36.000
You shouldn't have...

11:36.370 --> 11:36.850
Hot!

11:38.370 --> 11:40.240
My tongue feels like it's on a tin roof!

11:41.530 --> 11:44.910
I'm sick of this! We aren't going to catch up to Pikachu at this rate!

11:45.320 --> 11:47.910
Let's just drop trying to get Pikachu.

11:48.500 --> 11:51.870
All right then, let's get Operation: Monster Ball Snatching Ingenuity going!

11:52.450 --> 11:53.400
Roger!

11:57.190 --> 11:58.520
Pokémon Quiz.

11:58.830 --> 12:00.030
The answer is...?

12:01.890 --> 12:11.930
Coming up next:

12:01.890 --> 12:06.840
The Rocket Gang's plan!

12:02.840 --> 12:07.550
Pocket Monsters XY&Z is brought to you by these sponsors.

12:06.880 --> 12:11.930
Just what is this Pokémon-snatching ingenuity?

12:23.300 --> 12:24.670
Welcome.

12:25.170 --> 12:26.480
What's this room?

12:26.480 --> 12:29.410
It's an ingestion room that uses monster balls!

12:29.730 --> 12:30.920
It's an <i>ingenuity</i> room.

12:31.670 --> 12:33.210
It uses monster balls?

12:33.590 --> 12:35.960
You just need to place the monster balls you have on you...

12:36.700 --> 12:37.980
...on this, right?

12:40.020 --> 12:42.310
I don't think it's heavy enough.

12:45.410 --> 12:46.770
Maybe one more?

12:49.410 --> 12:50.400
Ah, it moved!

12:50.400 --> 12:51.290
All right!

12:57.620 --> 13:00.000
The monster balls have separated and gone in three different directions!

13:00.000 --> 13:00.480
Wow!

13:10.490 --> 13:12.770
The monster balls have come back together.

13:12.770 --> 13:13.330
Awesome!

13:20.330 --> 13:21.890
Where are my monster balls?

13:22.480 --> 13:24.310
All right, we have no need for the Trainer.

13:33.610 --> 13:35.930
Our Monster Ball Snatching Ingenuity...

13:35.930 --> 13:37.460
...is a big success!

13:37.460 --> 13:38.430
We did it!

13:41.130 --> 13:42.160
Welcome!

13:42.670 --> 13:43.930
What's this room?

13:43.930 --> 13:45.760
You make use of monster balls...

13:45.760 --> 13:47.360
...in this <i>ingestion</i> room!

13:50.320 --> 13:50.670
Huh?

13:51.060 --> 13:52.210
It's not moving.

13:52.210 --> 13:53.200
Maybe put one more?

13:53.920 --> 13:55.200
One more?

13:55.850 --> 13:56.770
It moved!

13:56.770 --> 13:57.210
Whoa!

13:59.060 --> 14:01.410
The monster balls have separated and gone in three different directions!

14:01.730 --> 14:02.790
Amazing!

14:05.260 --> 14:07.650
The monster balls have come back together.

14:07.650 --> 14:08.130
Wow!

14:09.710 --> 14:12.650
Uh? What? Where are my monster balls?

14:12.990 --> 14:14.740
All right, we have no need for the Trainer.

14:22.550 --> 14:23.800
Oh, Pikachu.

14:25.300 --> 14:26.060
Yancham!

14:27.090 --> 14:28.190
Did you all have fun?

14:35.720 --> 14:37.070
Geez, play nice!

14:38.220 --> 14:40.280
Huh? No, it's not this room...

14:40.710 --> 14:41.200
Is something the matter?

14:41.920 --> 14:45.710
Oh... The thing is, there have been several incidents in which people have had their monster balls taken away.

14:46.370 --> 14:47.490
Monster balls?

14:47.830 --> 14:48.920
Who would do such a thing...?

14:49.600 --> 14:50.420
Let's go have a look.

14:51.730 --> 14:55.070
Hey, my monster balls got...!

14:55.770 --> 14:56.900
Oh, it's here!

14:56.900 --> 14:57.180
Gulp!

14:57.630 --> 14:59.650
My monster balls got sucked into that hole...

15:00.540 --> 15:01.180
Watch out!

15:06.890 --> 15:07.780
Into this hole, you mean?

15:10.850 --> 15:11.450
This is it, right?

15:15.050 --> 15:17.790
What are you guys doing in an ingenuity room?!

15:18.270 --> 15:21.780
If you ask us "What are you guys doing in an ingress room?",

15:21.780 --> 15:22.730
It's "ingenuity".

15:22.730 --> 15:24.790
It is the world's mercy that makes us answer!

15:25.110 --> 15:25.680
Ha!

15:27.050 --> 15:28.790
To prevent the world's destruction!

15:29.350 --> 15:31.430
To protect the world's peace!

15:31.880 --> 15:34.260
Carrying out the evil of love and truth,

15:34.850 --> 15:37.010
we're lovely, charmy villains!

15:38.330 --> 15:39.010
Musashi!

15:39.400 --> 15:39.850
Kojiro!

15:40.760 --> 15:43.440
For the Rocket Gang duo dashing across the galaxy,

15:43.660 --> 15:46.290
a white hole, a white tomorrow awaits ahead!

15:46.560 --> 15:47.990
Just kidding!

15:50.310 --> 15:51.280
The Rocket Gang!

15:51.280 --> 15:52.480
Give back the monster balls!

15:52.860 --> 15:53.720
Let's run.

15:54.110 --> 15:54.850
Farewell!

15:56.480 --> 15:57.570
Hold it!

16:02.550 --> 16:03.730
Whoa, this is fun!

16:04.480 --> 16:05.750
Eureka, be careful!

16:06.810 --> 16:07.920
Wait!

16:08.300 --> 16:08.640
Ha!

16:08.860 --> 16:09.090
Hup!

16:09.560 --> 16:10.210
Hup!

16:10.210 --> 16:13.420
Musashi's good. She kept messing up earlier.

16:13.810 --> 16:17.560
I can only show my true talent in situations like these!

16:17.900 --> 16:19.960
That's what geniuses are like!

16:22.730 --> 16:24.710
You mustn't underestimate ingenuities!

16:25.030 --> 16:25.950
Wait!

16:25.950 --> 16:26.780
Here goes!

16:26.780 --> 16:27.030
Ha!

16:28.990 --> 16:29.340
Yes!

16:31.890 --> 16:32.440
Hold it!

16:34.450 --> 16:35.860
Give the monster balls back!

16:36.230 --> 16:38.910
The indignities you've seen so far are mere child's play compared to this one!

16:38.910 --> 16:40.330
I told you it was "ingenuities"!

16:40.820 --> 16:41.950
Nyarth, go for it!

16:42.780 --> 16:43.120
Roger!

16:46.230 --> 16:47.080
What's this?

16:49.450 --> 16:50.320
For three days and three sleepless nights,

16:50.920 --> 16:54.480
I worked towards the completion of this masterpiece ingenuity, only sleeping at daytime!

16:55.000 --> 16:55.670
I call it...

16:56.420 --> 17:00.690
...The Ultra Special Mega Mega Super Attack Ingenuity Nyarth!

17:01.140 --> 17:03.680
Now <i>that</i> is an ingenuity!

17:05.280 --> 17:06.430
Savor it thoroughly!

17:07.010 --> 17:08.510
I'm counting on you, Nyarth!

17:41.830 --> 17:43.440
Go, Indecency Nyarth!

17:43.990 --> 17:45.470
It's not an indecency! Geez!

17:56.530 --> 17:58.150
Fury Swipes!

18:12.390 --> 18:16.320
It would've been easier if Nyarth had just simply <i>taken a step forward</i> and used Fury Swipes!

18:16.320 --> 18:17.830
He didn't even reach Pikachu!

18:18.290 --> 18:20.880
Argh! Nonsense!

18:21.260 --> 18:22.930
Ingenuities are about playfulness!

18:23.210 --> 18:26.930
If you don't get that, you'll never understand the greatness of this device!

18:28.910 --> 18:32.140
This is the first time I sympathize with the Rocket Gang.

18:32.140 --> 18:33.640
This isn't the time to be impressed!

18:34.540 --> 18:36.520
Stop fooling around and give the monster balls back!

18:37.020 --> 18:38.000
Nope!

18:38.000 --> 18:39.630
Go, Pumpjin!

18:39.630 --> 18:41.050
Come out, Maaiika!

18:45.310 --> 18:46.300
Seed Bomb!

18:50.110 --> 18:51.000
Psybeam!

18:54.580 --> 18:55.830
Yancham, Dark Pulse!

18:59.360 --> 18:59.910
Evade it!

19:04.540 --> 19:05.970
Harimaron, Pin Missile!

19:14.090 --> 19:16.570
All right, Pikachu! Thunderbolt!

19:27.870 --> 19:31.330
I knew that ingenuities didn't suit my gender.

19:31.730 --> 19:33.280
I just don't get them...

19:33.280 --> 19:35.330
She finally said "ingenuity" right.

19:35.800 --> 19:37.810
Ingenuities are a male fantasy!

19:38.310 --> 19:40.330
It's okay if nobody understands me!

19:41.130 --> 19:43.340
This feels bad!

19:49.940 --> 19:52.220
Here, your monster balls are safe.

19:52.680 --> 19:53.610
Thank goodness!

19:53.610 --> 19:54.390
Thank you!

19:54.390 --> 19:55.270
Thanks!

19:55.850 --> 19:57.080
I'm so glad for you.

19:57.300 --> 19:58.610
Case closed.

19:58.610 --> 20:00.310
All right, let us go!

20:00.630 --> 20:04.860
There are still many ingenuity rooms left. Let us enjoy them the whole day.

20:05.300 --> 20:06.430
Let's go, Pikachu!

20:07.660 --> 20:08.870
Wahey!

20:10.670 --> 20:12.400
Ingenuities mean romanticism.

20:13.120 --> 20:15.470
They are compilations of humans' wits and creativity!

20:15.970 --> 20:20.350
Shouldering dreams and hopes for the future, the Ingenuity Festival continued.

21:47.560 --> 21:49.110
The latest news on the movie!

21:49.720 --> 22:05.570
Premieres Saturday July 16th

21:49.990 --> 21:52.940
"Ingenuity" will be an important keyword in the movie.

21:53.590 --> 21:59.400
The Azoth Kingdom, the setting of the adventure, also hides various Pokémon-inspired ingenuities.

22:00.100 --> 22:05.160
We have super-big news on the ingenious Pokémon Magearna, who was created in this kingdom.

22:06.360 --> 22:11.550
Incredibly, you will receive a Magearna Ga-Olé disc as a movie attendance gift!

22:12.310 --> 22:17.260
Try battling in Pokémon Ga-Olé, which you can play in stores nationwide starting July.

22:18.240 --> 22:19.700
If you have this disc,

22:19.700 --> 22:25.960
you can also befriend Magearna in Pocket Monsters Sun/Moon, which be released in November!

22:26.710 --> 22:30.530
Come on, you set off on an adventure together with Magearna too!

22:31.720 --> 22:36.230
